sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Citizen
    participant W as Web/USSD
    participant API
    participant E as Intelligence
    participant DB
    participant R as Responder

    C->>W: Submit incident
    W->>API: Create incident
    API->>E: Validate/classify/priority
    E-->>API: Result + reasons
    API->>DB: Store incident + audit
    DB-->>API: Incident ID
    API-->>W: Confirmation
    R->>API: View queue
    API->>DB: Query incidents
    DB-->>API: Incidents
    R->>API: Assign team
    API->>DB: Save assignment
    API-->>C: Status update
    R->>API: Resolve
    API->>DB: Save resolution
